            korean: `<p><span class="korean-word" data-translation="на крайнем востоке" data-pronunciation="대한민국의 동쪽 끝 [daehanmingukui dongjjok kkeut]">대한민국의 동쪽 끝</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="на острове Уллындо" data-pronunciation="울릉도에서 [ulleungdo-eseo]">울릉도에서</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="тридцать лет" data-pronunciation="삼십 년간 [samsip nyeongan]">삼십 년간</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="маяк" data-pronunciation="등대를 [deungdaereul]">등대를</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="охранявший" data-pronunciation="지켜온 [jikyeoon]">지켜온</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="смотритель Ким" data-pronunciation="김 지기님이 [gim jiginiemi]">김 지기님이</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="есть" data-pronunciation="계십니다 [gyesimnida]">계십니다</span>.</p>
<p><span class="korean-word" data-translation="теперь" data-pronunciation="이제 [ije]">이제</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="маяки" data-pronunciation="등대는 [deungdae-neun]">등대는</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="автоматизированы" data-pronunciation="자동화되었습니다 [jadongwadoeeotseumnida]">자동화되었습니다</span>. <span class="korean-word" data-translation="смотрители" data-pronunciation="등대지기는 [deungdaejigineun]">등대지기는</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="больше не нужны" data-pronunciation="더 이상 필요 없습니다 [deo isang piryo eopseumnida]">더 이상 필요 없습니다</span>. <span class="korean-word" data-translation="но" data-pronunciation="그러나 [geureona]">그러나</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="Ким" data-pronunciation="김 지기님은 [gim jigimineun]">김 지기님은</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="остаётся" data-pronunciation="남아 있습니다 [nama itseumnida]">남아 있습니다</span>. <span class="korean-word" data-translation="каждый вечер" data-pronunciation="매일 저녁 [maeil jeonyeok]">매일 저녁</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="свет маяка" data-pronunciation="등대 불빛을 [deungdae bulbicheul]">등대 불빛을</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="проверяет" data-pronunciation="확인하고 [hwaginhago]">확인하고</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="линзу" data-pronunciation="렌즈를 [renjeureul]">렌즈를</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="полирует" data-pronunciation="닦습니다 [dakseumnida]">닦습니다</span>.</p>
<p><span class="korean-word" data-translation="он говорит" data-pronunciation="그는 말합니다 [geuneun malhamnida]">그는 말합니다</span>. <span class="korean-word" data-translation="море" data-pronunciation="바다는 [badaneun]">바다는</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="память" data-pronunciation="기억입니다 [gieokimnida]">기억입니다</span>. <span class="korean-word" data-translation="этот свет" data-pronunciation="이 빛은 [i bicheun]">이 빛은</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="сто лет назад рыбаков" data-pronunciation="백 년 전 어부들의 [baek nyeon jeon eobudeului]">백 년 전 어부들의</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="дорогу домой" data-pronunciation="귀향길을 [gwihyanggireul]">귀향길을</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="освещал" data-pronunciation="밝혔습니다 [balkheotseumnida]">밝혔습니다</span>. <span class="korean-word" data-translation="я" data-pronunciation="저는 [jeoneun]">저는</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="ту память" data-pronunciation="그 기억을 [geu gieogeul]">그 기억을</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="храню" data-pronunciation="지키는 것입니다 [jikineun geosimnida]">지키는 것입니다</span>. <span class="korean-word" data-translation="в последний день на посту" data-pronunciation="마지막 근무 날 [majimak geunmu nal]">마지막 근무 날</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="он" data-pronunciation="그는 [geuneun]">그는</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="тихо" data-pronunciation="조용히 [joyonghi]">조용히</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="светом маяка" data-pronunciation="등대 불빛과 [deungdae bulbitgwa]">등대 불빛과</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="попрощался" data-pronunciation="작별했습니다 [jakbyeolhaetseumnida]">작별했습니다</span>.</p>`,
            translation: "На самом востоке Южной Кореи, на острове Уллындо, смотритель Ким тридцать лет охранял маяк. Теперь маяки автоматизированы, смотрители больше не нужны. Но он остаётся. Каждый вечер проверяет свет и полирует линзу. «Море — это память, — говорит он. — Этот свет сто лет назад освещал дорогу рыбакам домой. Я храню эту память». В последний рабочий день он тихо попрощался со светом маяка.",
